@jliu-tessera commented on this issue.

Confirmed. We only read the top-level memberOf values from the assertion, so anyone whose role comes from a nested AD group gets the default viewer role. Two customers use nested groups, so this matters.

Fix: flatten group membership during the assertion parse, cap depth at 5, cache per session. Sofia has it in #244, targeting this sprint.

